# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Intentionally TRACKED (do not add these to the ignore list)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# google_trends_keywords.xlsx   - input keyword list for the notebook
# raw_pulls/                    - cached Google Trends pulls; Google's data changes
#                                 slightly between pulls and the "today 5-y" window
#                                 moves, so these keep the analysis reproducible
# trends_weekly_*.csv           - stitched and cleaned weekly tables (small)
# trends_spike_weeks.csv        - spike-week flags

